<title>USA: Suffolk Bancorp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Suffolk Bancorp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>RIVERHEAD, N.Y. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suffolk Bancorp Wednesday said its shareholders approved a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record May 1, will receive the extra share payable May 15.</p>
</text>
